  "novelty_note": "Verification/extension of a known result (e.g. Bedaque & Steiner 2015, PRL 114, 031103; Tews, Carlson, Gandolfi, Reddy 2018, ApJ 860, 149): 2 M_sun stars with a nucleonic EOS trusted to ~1-2 n_sat require c_s^2 well above 1/3 somewhere. Specific numbers are for SLy below n_m and the two completions defined here.",
